    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a [mandatory release manifest requirement](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for all Meridian deployments, formalizing this as a [ratified gate](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) that extends across both [staging and production environments](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4). This directive is framed as a [direct response to past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), specifically the unauthorized arrival of unsigned artifacts in staging. Fairweather has assumed [direct ownership of this policy](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5), shifting from a descriptive stance to an authoritative, decision-based register.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
